{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與李炘頤（Alina）昨天（15日）於社交平台上載婚照，宣布已簽字結為夫婦。</p><p>早前有消息指兩人將於月底赴東南亞舉辦婚禮，據悉，他們已定於10月25日在峇里島舉辦婚宴，並邀請約50名親友出席。</p><p>MIRROR全體成員亦已協調日程，準備飛赴當地祝賀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:03:05.659993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:56:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:37.659072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:13.993977+00:00","content_hash":"06dc78e56480ee3d158ab6b0ddf2de9f647e172fa6db939984e82b55aa367579","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}